<Publisher title="Delivery & reader support — Scale of Us"><section class="page-intro wrap"><p class="eyebrow">READER SUPPORT</p><h1>A little help,<br /><em>before you begin.</em></h1></section><div class="prose-layout wrap"><aside><a href="#reading">Reading & listening</a><a href="#delivery">Shipping</a><a href="#returns">Returns & damage</a><a href="#privacy">Privacy</a></aside><article><section id="reading"><h2>Reading & listening</h2><p>Online reading is free. Choose English or Spanish and move at your own pace. For immersive reading, open the reader and press Listen. You can pause and choose a chapter.</p><p>If audio doesn’t start, press Listen again after checking your device’s sound settings. The text remains available while playback is paused.</p></section><section id="delivery"><h2>Shipping</h2><p>The signed printed edition ships within the United States. Shipping is $12 per order for one or two copies. Applicable sales tax is calculated at checkout. Orders normally dispatch within five business days, with tracking sent after the parcel leaves.</p><p>If an order cannot dispatch within the promised time, we will offer a revised shipping date. You may accept the delay or cancel the unshipped order for a full refund.</p>{!checkout.enabled && <p class="local-notice">The shop is not open yet. Checkout is being prepared.</p>}</section><section id="returns"><h2>Returns, damage & incorrect orders</h2><p>Because these are signed books from a small batch, sales are final for change of mind. Please report a damaged, defective, or incorrect book within 14 calendar days of delivery and include the order number and clear photographs.</p><p>We will replace the book when a copy is available. If replacement is unavailable, we will refund the book and its original shipping charge. Please wait for return instructions before sending anything back.</p></section><section id="privacy"><h2>Orders, reflections & privacy</h2><p>Stripe processes payments and collects the name, email and delivery address you provide at checkout. Scale of Us uses this information to fulfil your order and provide support. Card details are handled by Stripe. <a href="https://stripe.com/privacy">Stripe’s privacy policy →</a></p><p>Reader reflections are sent through Formspree to Scale of Us. Your response stays private unless you choose “OK to share publicly.” <a href="/reflections/">Read more or leave a reflection →</a></p></section></article></div></Publisher>
